                "description": "Fusion AG-Z8, Rope Leverset - The Rope Leverset will add charm and glamor to any door. The Ornate Rope Lever with matching Rope Rose has concealed screw mounting for a beautiful installation. It is available in 5 finishes including brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and polished brass. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an adjustable backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
